{"id":"completamente","lemma":"completamente","pos":"adv","rank":571,"glosses":["completely"],"ipa":"/komˌpletaˈmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-completamente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él estaba completamente despierto.","en":"He was wide awake.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/702951"},{"text":"Ahora estoy completamente solo.","en":"I'm all alone now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/550152"},{"text":"Ella está completamente desnuda.","en":"She's stark naked.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/637014"},{"text":"Eso es completamente absurdo.","en":"That's quite absurd.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449795"},{"text":"Él está completamente loco.","en":"He's completely crazy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636463"}]}